overload storageBarrier VOID_0 VOID - NONE
overload textureBarrier VOID_0 VOID - NONE
overload workgroupBarrier VOID_0 VOID - NONE
overload workgroupUniformLoad WORKGROUP_UNIFORM_LOAD ARG0 must_use NONE

